  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-chat-export · 会话导出书签",
      "text": "One tool that generates a **bookmarklet**: drag to bookmarks bar, click on any chat page → auto-scrolls to trigger lazy loading, grabs the full conversation, downloads a txt + copies to clipboard, with a media-attachment inventory (images/audio/video/file links)."
    },
    {
      "section": "用法",
      "text": "①让AI跑 `chat_export`（可选传站点专用CSS选择器）→②拿到单行书签码→③浏览器新建书签粘贴→④打开聊天页点书签即导出。"
    },
    {
      "section": "定制",
      "text": "通用选择器自动试探 message/bubble/chat-item/dialog 等；某站抓不全时传该站选择器重新生成一条专属书签码。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "```\ndsh plugin add github:xushilianzhuren/dsh-chat-export\n```\nMIT License."
    }
  ],
